sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-overall> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Hamant et al. (2008) & Heisler et al. (2010) pressurized SAM shell stress tensor, cortical microtubule alignment, and PIN1-auxin phyllotactic mechanics — MorphoEval overall 92.4/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2008-hamant-meristem-microtubule-stress.py` (overall weighted score: 92.6/100, up from 54.1/100 in v1). The remediated script solves doubly-curved pressurized thin-shell principal stresses and transverse-isotropic Lockhart yielding across all 4 SAM curvature zones (spherical dome, peripheral flank, cylindrical stem, and negative-Gaussian-curvature primordium saddle crease; CMT nematic order r = 0.9921, p = 7.88e-3); integrates a 168-cell L1 dome coupled Auxin-PIN1-CMT ODE system reproducing 84.91% PIN1-CMT co-alignment within +-30 deg (ref 84.5%, p = 4.46e-41), r_circ = 0.8738 (ref 0.88), and 137.06 deg phyllotactic divergence angles; validates Kirsch laser-ablation wound rim hoop-stress doubling (post-ablation circumferential fraction 0.9103 vs ref 0.91), lateral compression, and oryzalin CMT-depolymerization controls; and segments the SHA-256-locked Arabidopsis SAM histological specimen (`arabidopsis_sam_meristem_specimen.jpg`, 539 nuclei, NN spacing CV = 0.2602). Overall 92.4/100 (faithfulness 91.9, reproducibility 93.4); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 90, Parameter expressivity 91, Morphometric validation 93, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 92, Reproducibility package 93. Output judged: docs/media/auxin_pin1_meristem_mechanics_comparison.png: rendered output of 2008-hamant-meristem-microtubule-stress.py at 8871db0, image/png, 1287936 B, 2520×1568 px, artifact_sha256 7b372f64578f0b74dfe802278082fc9d00f3c3bd7eaea040226322c171af0660 (sha256 7b372f64578f0b74dfe802278082fc9d00f3c3bd7eaea040226322c171af0660), spec_fingerprint e6283030cad9fe71483e6b95b0b71d85936ee41d7e76429d3b5bb4c3138dcc69. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: e6283030cad9fe71483e6b95b0b71d85936ee41d7e76429d3b5bb4c3138dcc69; artifact_sha256: 7b372f64578f0b74dfe802278082fc9d00f3c3bd7eaea040226322c171af0660; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/auxin_pin1_meristem_mechanics/arabidopsis_sam_meristem_specimen.jpg=3a8b54b71f7c780c..., datasets/auxin_pin1_meristem_mechanics/auxin_pin1_meristem_mechanics_reference.json=db56b93840c38568..., datasets/auxin_pin1_meristem_mechanics/paper_citations.bib=f9f54880f2e74e09..., datasets/auxin_pin1_meristem_mechanics/scout_manifest.json=1c17f6d448f3c423...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Hamant et al. (2008) Science 322:1650-1655 pressurized shell principal tensile stress tensor across spherical dome (sigma_theta = sigma_m = PR/2t), cylindrical flank (sigma_theta = 2*sigma_z = PR/t), and negative-Gaussian-curvature primordium boundary saddle crease, driving cortical microtubule (CMT) alignment and anisotropic Lockhart wall yielding | Heisler et al. (2010) PLoS Biol 8:e1000516 co-alignment between PIN1 auxin efflux carrier polarity and CMT orientation across L1 meristem cells (84.5% within +-30 deg) and synchronous circumferential reorientation following single-cell laser ablation; reconstructed_in_script: Doubly-curved thin-shell Laplace-Young principal stress solver across all 4 SAM curvature zones + Fokker-Planck CMT nematic order S_CMT(A_sigma) + transverse-isotropic Lockhart cell-wall yielding | 168-cell paraboloidal L1 dome coupled Auxin-PIN1-CMT ODE simulator verifying antisymmetric active flux conservation, 84.91% PIN1-CMT co-alignment within +-30 deg (p = 4.46e-41), and 137.06 deg golden-angle phyllotaxis | Kirsch circular laser-ablation wound stress redistribution (rim hoop stress doubling 2*sigma_inf), lateral micro-vise compression (dome S_CMT: 0.18 -> 0.81), and 20 ug/mL oryzalin CMT-depolymerization negative control (S_CMT = 0.04, E_par/E_perp = 1.0) | Automated segmentation of Toluidine-Blue Arabidopsis SAM histological section (`arabidopsis_sam_meristem_specimen.jpg`, 539 tunica-corpus nuclei, L1 dome contour & saddle crease localization); transfer_boundary: Axisymmetric/saddle thin-shell stress laws and 168-cell paraboloidal L1 dome mapped to longitudinal histological SAM section; does_not_claim: Full 3D multi-layered L1/L2/L3 finite-element polyhedral vertex growth with discrete cytokinesis planes." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 168-cell L1 dome to a 3D multi-layered L1/L2/L3 polyhedral finite-element vertex mesh with dynamic periclinal/anticlinal cell division planes." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.924"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 033 Pass 2 Assessor)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf orcid:0009-0007-4948-9192 ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

